  "label": "The woman in construction attire is mapped as the 'finest' example of workplace equality.",
  "description": "The text 'equality in the work place at its finest' is mapped onto the visual entity 'woman_in_construction_scene'. The meme uses the woman's presence in a traditionally male-dominated field as the visual representation of the textual claim that workplace equality has reached its 'finest' point. This mapping is sarcastic and ironic, implying that her presence is exceptional or rare, thereby reinforcing a misogynous stereotype that women do not naturally belong in such roles. The woman's slight smile and direct gaze further imply she is aware of and perhaps mocking this framing.",
